{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b1a7c6d4-6f2e-4f6a-9c1e-bitmax000001",
    "name": "BitMax Ticketing API",
    "description": "End-to-end collection for the BitMax MERN ticketing assignment.\n\n1. Import `BitMax-Ticketing.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Run **Auth → Login (password)**; the access and refresh tokens are saved automatically.\n3. Run **Categories → List categories** (saves `categoryId`).\n4. Run **Tickets → Create ticket** (saves `ticketId`).\n5. Continue through Messages, Activity, Dashboard and Email.\n\nSeed accounts (password `Password123!`):\n- admin@bitmax.test\n- agent@bitmax.test\n- customer@bitmax.test\n\nAll endpoints exist under both `/api/v1` and `/api`; the environment uses `/api/v1`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "ticketId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "messageId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "activityId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "agentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "sessionId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
